00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.620
In college, Lauren was a
passionate softball player.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.370
Then she suffered a severe injury

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:14.780
on the field that was devastating

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.700
physically and psychologically.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.740
As a way to cope, she turned
to her second love, art,

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.130
and it changed horse of her entire life.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.980
Now, not only is she a licensed artist

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.390
for Major League Baseball
depicting top athletes

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.190
including Clayton Kershaw and Mike Piazza.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.430
She's also using her craft

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.320
to celebrate and honor her heroes.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.790
We have Lauren, dialed in right now

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:36.510
who watches on City TV
in British Columbia.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.677
So Lauren, hello?
(audience cheering)

00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:40.400
- Hello.
(audience cheering)

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.000
- My, Gosh! You are also very beautiful.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.650
So I'm gonna lead with that.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.480
So how, how did you get into art?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.100
- You know, I started in high school

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.030
just kind of as a way to cope with.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:53.350
I struggled with a bit of mental health

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.350
in high school as well.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.640
So it was kind of my
way to cope with anxiety

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.280
and depression and things
I didn't really know

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.113
how to talk about,

00:00:59.113 --> 00:01:01.470
so I did just a little bit then and yeah.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:03.430
But it was mostly focused on sports.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.540
- Yeah, no, I did the same thing.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.840
That's why I became a songwriter.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.880
I think a lot of people
have to find those outlets

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.280
especially around that time in our lives.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.367
It's a hard time.

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:12.135
So you try to give the celebrities

00:01:12.135 --> 00:01:15.020
