00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:42.620
By the way, I love Elle King.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.510
I love that you did, Elle King.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:44.570
She's so cool.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.007
Wait, you did this for me.

00:01:46.007 --> 00:01:48.759
(audience applauding)

00:01:48.759 --> 00:01:49.592
