things about me too.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.750
And like, I love Aretha, I love this.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:12.583
- Thank you.

00:02:12.583 --> 00:02:14.940
Yeah, I do a bit of research
before I start the project.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.280
I call them gratitude projects.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.510
So I usually look for
someone that's done something

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:22.540
