00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.210
and I learned about a
bit where you were from,

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.630
so I wanted to tie that into the piece

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.400
that I created for you.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.440
- I love it so much.
(audience applauding)

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.960
I don't even know if you knew this,

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.810
